# 1Password plugin aliases disabled.
# GITHUB_TOKEN is already set from macOS Keychain (env.zsh → security find-generic-password)
# seeded by `sync-secrets` which pulls from 1Password → Keychain (~25ms vs ~3s).
# The `op plugin run -- gh` alias required interactive biometric auth on every call,
# which broke non-interactive contexts (tmux panes, AI agents, scripts).
#
# Previously this file sourced ~/.config/op/plugins.sh which set:
#   alias gh="op plugin run -- gh"
#
# If you need to re-enable op plugins for other CLIs, add them here selectively
# but exclude `gh` since it's covered by GITHUB_TOKEN.
